fixes. <br /> <br /> If you're using Third Edition, the answer gets a bit more tricky. There's no current 3e book fully detailing Sidereals. If you're using them as NPCs, there's an example as a Quick Character in the Antagonists section of the Core book (pp. 547-549), and that section discusses how their essence pools and Excellencies work, so you could create more NPCs as QCs using that. If you want to introduce them as player characters, however, you're basically going to have to either come up with rules yourself, or use one of the existing fan-made 3e conversions of Sidereals. I'm personally fond of &quot;<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T4FTsSprLYd8KWXgE5Rr1x7C9_B6Ln5cnGN8HF7a3Vk/edit#heading=h.ccagel7i0hsv\" target=\"_blank\">Where Fate Has Led</a>&quot;, but some searching will turn up others as well.<br /> <br /> So, does that answer your question? Do you have others?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-12T11:52:33-07:00","id":1245150,"title":"","content":"Yes thanks. And its 3rd edition has npc. Il check tour link","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23883-devaking","name":"devaking","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23883_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","valu